@startuml TBOT-FallbackShell
title Domain · fallback-shell — app-level error & safety screens
left to right direction

actor Child
actor Parent

package "fallback-shell" {
  usecase "View Network Error"      as UC_FB_NET
  usecase "View Mic Missing"        as UC_FB_MIC
  usecase "Audio Permission Recovery" as UC_FB_AUDIO
  usecase "View Voice Failed"       as UC_FB_VOICE
  usecase "Resume Lesson"           as UC_FB_RESUME
  usecase "Reconnecting Overlay"    as UC_FB_RECONN
  usecase "Safety Redirect"         as UC_FB_SAFETY
  usecase "View Generic App Error"  as UC_FB_APP
}

Child --> UC_FB_NET
Child --> UC_FB_MIC
Child --> UC_FB_VOICE
Child --> UC_FB_RESUME
Child --> UC_FB_RECONN
Child --> UC_FB_SAFETY
Child --> UC_FB_APP
Parent --> UC_FB_AUDIO

UC_FB_MIC   ..> UC_FB_AUDIO  : <<extend>> "Get a grown-up"
UC_FB_VOICE ..> UC_FB_RESUME : <<extend>> "Pick up where we left off"
UC_FB_NET   ..> UC_FB_RECONN : "Try again"

note bottom of UC_FB_RESUME
  [exit] → lesson-session : UC_LSN_LISTEN_BOT (resumes)
end note
note bottom of UC_FB_RECONN
  [exit] → lesson-session : UC_LSN_LISTEN_KID
end note
note bottom of UC_FB_SAFETY
  Cross-cuts: invoked by lesson-session safety,
  also reachable from kid-settings.
end note

' In-session recovery (UC_LSN_RECONN, UC_LSN_AUDIO) lives in lesson-session.puml.
' Files: src/features/fallback/*Page.jsx
@enduml
